  "title": "Honey-Mustard Baked Chicken Legs",
  "description": "These baked chicken legs have a wonderful sweet honey-mustard flavor. You can also use chicken thighs for this recipe.",
  "authors": [
    "Tarahlynn Sweitzer"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-01-29T07:08:07-05:00",
